# Optional: connect a static-form service (Formspree, Getform, Basin, etc.)
# so booking inquiries POST directly from the page with a real success/error
# state. Without these set, the Booking form falls back to a working
# mailto: link — inquiries are never silently dropped either way.
#
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in your real endpoint(s).
VITE_TATTOO_FORM_ENDPOINT=
VITE_AIRBRUSH_FORM_ENDPOINT=
VITE_HALLOWEEN_FORM_ENDPOINT=
